Alpoge JC(3) counterexample:
   det J = -2   component degrees = [7, 6, 4]
   F(0, 0, -1/4)           = [-1/4, 0, 0]
   F(1, -3/2, 13/2)        = [-1/4, 0, 0]
   F(-1, 3/2, 13/2)        = [-1/4, 0, 0]
   => constant nonzero Jacobian determinant but not injective.
